From f0389cc31f5a6675318c73dba4f1aba28cc2e463 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 17:06:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Vendor cfb 0.14.0 so the Tauri build no longer downloads it

cfb (Compound File Binary) reaches us through tauri -> infer and the
crates.io download is blocked on some machines. The library source now
lives in desktop/src-tauri/vendor/cfb (MIT, same version, benches/tests
dropped) and [patch.crates-io] points cargo at it; Cargo.lock updated.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01K5M7FnXPWrv7D7XYUXLqa1
